ices (both internal and external)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">Creating Additional Services (If required)</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:328px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9193804756/original/SuvV5jLSOBCJjo_h1Uc0S4xf5q7U9srEPQ.png?1692905276\" width=\"602\" height=\"328\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9193804756\"></span><br><br></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Assigning Services</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Navigation:</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;Practice Management &gt; Settings &gt; Services &gt; Assign Services</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">It is important to assign custom/created services to your clients. You can do it on a client specific basis as well as in bulk. To complete this task, you are required to:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: